38<br/></td>\n<td>24th<br/></td>\n<td>820<br/></td>\n<td>82<br/></td>\n<td>41<br/></td>\n<td>21<br/></td>\n<td>11<br/></td>\n<td>6<br/></td>\n<td>3<br/></td>\n<td>2<br/></td>\n<td>1<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"13\" curcol=\"13\">\n<td>39<br/></td>\n<td>24th<br/></td>\n<td>910<br/></td>\n<td>91<br/></td>\n<td>46<br/></td>\n<td>23<br/></td>\n<td>12<br/></td>\n<td>6<br/></td>\n<td>3<br/></td>\n<td>2<br/></td>\n<td>1<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"13\" curcol=\"13\">\n<td>40<br/></td>\n<td>25th<br/></td>\n<td>1000<br/></td>\n<td>100<br/></td>\n<td>50<br/></td>\n<td>25<br/></td>\n<td>13<br/></td>\n<td>7<br/></td>\n<td>4<br/></td>\n<td>2<br/></td>\n<td>1<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"13\" curcol=\"13\">\n<td>per +1<br/></td>\n<td>+1/2*<br/></td>\n<td>+100**<br/></td>\n<td><sup><b>!</b></sup><br/></td>\n<td><sup><b>!</b></sup><br/></td>\n<td><sup><b>!</b></sup><br/></td>\n<td><sup><b>!</b></sup><br/></td>\n<td><sup><b>!</b></sup><br/></td>\n<td><sup><b>!</b></sup><br/></td>\n<td><sup><b>!</b></sup><br/></td>\n<td><sup><b>!</b></sup><br/></td>\n<td><sup><b>!</b></sup><br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n</table><p/>\n</div><div topic=\"Leadership Score\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Leadership Score:</b> A character\'s Leadership score equals his or her level plus any Charisma modifier. Outside factors can affect a character\'s Leadership score, as detailed in the Leadership feat.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Cohort Level\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Cohort Level:</b> The character can attract a cohort of up to this level. Regardless of the character\'s Leadership score, he or she can\'t recruit a cohort of his or her level or higher.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Number of Followers by Level\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Number of Followers by Level:</b> The character can lead up to the indicated number of characters of each level.</p><p>*The maximum cohort level increases by 1 for every 2 points of Leadership above 40. **The number of 1st-level followers increases by 100 for every point of Leadership above 40.</p><p><sup><b>!</b></sup>A character can command one-tenth as many 2nd-level followers as 1st-level followers. A character can command one-half as many 3rd-level followers as 2nd-level followers, one-half as many 4th-level followers as 3rd-level followers, and so on (round fractions up, except any fraction less than 1 rounds to 0). A character can\'t have a follower of higher than 20th level.</p><p>Table: Example Special Epic Cohorts presents some creatures that make good cohorts for epic characters.</p><p/>\n</div><div topic=\"Table: Example Special Epic Cohorts\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Table: Example Special Epic Cohorts</b></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\">\n\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td><b>Creature</b><br/></td> <td><b>Alignment</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Level Equivalent</b><br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td>Angel, astral deva<br/></td>\n<td>Any good<br/></td>\n<td>20nd<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td>Dragon, ancient silver<br/></td>\n<td>Lawful good<br/></td>\n<td>42nd<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td>Couatl<br/></td>\n<td>Lawful good<br/></td>\n<td>16th<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td>Giant, cloud<br/></td>\n<td>Neutral good<br/></td>\n<td>24th<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td>Ghaele<br/></td>\n<td>Chaotic good<br/></td>\n<td>20st<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td>Giant, storm<br/></td>\n<td>Chaotic good<br/></td>\n<td>28th<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td>Dragon, wyrm brass<br/></td>\n<td>Chaotic good<br/></td>\n<td>42th<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td>Dragon turtle<br/></td>\n<td>Neutral<br/></td>\n<td>21st<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td>Hydra, 12-headed<br/></td>\n<td>Neutral<br/></td>\n<td>19th<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td>Roc<br/></td>\n<td>Neutral<br/></td>\n<td>23rd<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td>Dragon, ancient green<br/></td>\n<td>Lawful evil<br/></td>\n<td>40th<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td>Devil, ice (gelugon)<br/></td>\n<td>Lawful evil<br/></td>\n<td>21st<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td>Giant, cloud<br/></td>\n<td>Neutral evil<br/></td>\n<td>24th<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td>Demon, glabrezu<br/></td>\n<td>Chaotic evil<br/></td>\n<td>23rd<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td>Demon, succubus<br/></td>\n<td>Chaotic evil<br/></td>\n<td>12th<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"4\" curcol=\"4\">\n<td>Dragon, wyrm white<br/></td>\n<td>Chaotic evil<br/></td>\n<td>41th<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n</table><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (58,'Epic Prowess','Epic','Yes','Yes',NULL,NULL,'<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Gain a +1 bonus on all attacks.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.','\n      <div topic=\"Epic Prowess\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Epic Prowess [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Gain a +1 bonus on all attacks.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (59,'Epic Psionic Focus','Epic, Psionic','Yes','Yes',NULL,'Character level 21st, ability to manifest powers of the normal maximum power level in at least one psionic class.','<p>You can expend your psionic focus to greater effect.</p><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> When you expend your psionic focus, you can simultaneously use two feats that require a psionic focus to be expended, instead of just one. The feats must be stackable. You must still spend the requisite power points required to use each metapsionic feat, and you cannot exceed the power point limit set by your manifester level.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'You can take this feat multiple times. Each time you do so, you can simultaneously use one additional feat that requires a psionic focus to be expended.','\n      <div topic=\"Epic Psionic Focus\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Epic Psionic Focus [Epic, Psionic]</h3></p><p>You can expend your psionic focus to greater effect.</p><div topic=\"Prerequisites\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Character level 21st, ability to manifest powers of the normal maximum power level in at least one psionic class.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> When you expend your psionic focus, you can simultaneously use two feats that require a psionic focus to be expended, instead of just one. The feats must be stackable. You must still spend the requisite power points required to use each metapsionic feat, and you cannot exceed the power point limit set by your manifester level.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> You can take this feat multiple times. Each time you do so, you can simultaneously use one additional feat that requires a psionic focus to be expended.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (60,'Epic Reflexes','Epic','No','No',NULL,NULL,'<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character gains a +4 bonus on all Reflex saving throws.</p><p/>\n</div>\n',NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Epic Reflexes\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Epic Reflexes [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character gains a +4 bonus on all Reflex saving throws.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (61,'Epic Reputation','Epic','No','No',NULL,NULL,'<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character gains a +4 bonus on Bluff, Diplomacy, Gather Information, Intimidate, and Perform checks.</p><p/>\n</div>\n',NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Epic Reputation\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Epic Reputation [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character gains a +4 bonus on Bluff, Diplomacy, Gather Information, Intimidate, and Perform checks.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (62,'Epic Skill Focus','Epic','Yes','No','A different skill','20 ranks in the skill selected.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character gains a +10 bonus on all skill checks with that skill.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time a character takes the feat, it applies to a different skill.','\n      <div topic=\"Epic Skill Focus\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Epic Skill Focus [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisite\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> 20 ranks in the skill selected.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character gains a +10 bonus on all skill checks with that skill.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time a character takes the feat, it applies to a different skill.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (63,'Epic Speed','Epic','No','No',NULL,'Dex 21, Run.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s speed increases by 30 feet. This benefit does not stack with increased speed granted by magic items or nonpermanent magical effects.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'This feat only functions when the character is wearing medium armor, light armor, or no armor.','\n      <div topic=\"Epic Speed\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Epic Speed [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisites\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Dex 21, Run.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s speed increases by 30 feet. This benefit does not stack with increased speed granted by magic items or nonpermanent magical effects.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> This feat only functions when the character is wearing medium armor, light armor, or no armor.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (64,'Epic Spell Focus','Epic','Yes','No','A different school of magic','Greater Spell Focus and Spell Focus in the school selected, ability to cast at least one 9th-level spell of the school to be chosen.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Add +1 to the Difficulty Class for all saving throws against spells from the school of magic the character selects to focus on. This stacks with the bonuses from Spell Focus and Greater Spell Focus.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time the character takes the feat, it applies to a different school of magic.','\n      <div topic=\"Epic Spell Focus\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Epic Spell Focus [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisites\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Greater Spell Focus and Spell Focus in the school selected, ability to cast at least one 9th-level spell of the school to be chosen.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Add +1 to the Difficulty Class for all saving throws against spells from the school of magic the character selects to focus on. This stacks with the bonuses from Spell Focus and Greater Spell Focus.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time the character takes the feat, it applies to a different school of magic.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (65,'Epic Spell Penetration','Epic','No','No',NULL,'Greater Spell Penetration, Spell Penetration.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character gets a +2 bonus on caster level checks to beat a creature\'s spell resistance. This stacks with the bonuses from Spell Penetration and Greater Spell Penetration.</p><p/>\n</div>\n',NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Epic Spell Penetration\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Epic Spell Penetration [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisites\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Greater Spell Penetration, Spell Penetration.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character gets a +2 bonus on caster level checks to beat a creature\'s spell resistance. This stacks with the bonuses from Spell Penetration and Greater Spell Penetration.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (66,'Epic Spellcasting','Epic','No','No',NULL,'Spellcraft 24 ranks, Knowledge (arcana) 24 ranks, ability to cast 9th-level arcane spells. OR Spellcraft 24 ranks, Knowledge (religion) 24 ranks, ability to cast 9th-level divine spells. OR Spellcraft 24 ranks, Knowledge (nature) 24 ranks, ability to cast 9th-level divine spells.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character may develop and cast epic spells.  If the character is an arcane spellcaster, he or she may cast a number of epic spells per day equal to his or her ranks in Knowledge (arcana) divided by 10. If the character is a divine spellcaster, he or she may cast a number of epic spells per day equal to his or her ranks in Knowledge (religion) or Knowledge (nature) divided by 10.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'If the character meets more than one set of prerequisites, the limit on the number of spells he or she may cast per day is cumulative.','\n      <div topic=\"Epic Spellcasting\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Epic Spellcasting [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisite\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> Spellcraft 24 ranks, Knowledge (arcana) 24 ranks, ability to cast 9th-level arcane spells. OR Spellcraft 24 ranks, Knowledge (religion) 24 ranks, ability to cast 9th-level divine spells. OR Spellcraft 24 ranks, Knowledge (nature) 24 ranks, ability to cast 9th-level divine spells.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character may develop and cast epic spells.  If the character is an arcane spellcaster, he or she may cast a number of epic spells per day equal to his or her ranks in Knowledge (arcana) divided by 10. If the character is a divine spellcaster, he or she may cast a number of epic spells per day equal to his or her ranks in Knowledge (religion) or Knowledge (nature) divided by 10.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> If the character meets more than one set of prerequisites, the limit on the number of spells he or she may cast per day is cumulative.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (67,'Epic Toughness','Epic','Yes','Yes',NULL,NULL,'<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character gains +30 hit points.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.','\n      <div topic=\"Epic Toughness\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Epic Toughness [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character gains +30 hit points.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (68,'Epic Weapon Focus','Epic','Yes','No','A different type of weapon','Weapon Focus in the chosen weapon.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Add a +2 bonus to all attack rolls the character makes using the selected weapon.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time the character takes the feat it applies to a different type of weapon.','\n      <div topic=\"Epic Weapon Focus\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Epic Weapon Focus [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisite\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> Weapon Focus in the chosen weapon.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Add a +2 bonus to all attack rolls the character makes using the selected weapon.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time the character takes the feat it applies to a different type of weapon.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (69,'Epic Weapon Specialization','Epic','Yes','No','A different type of weapon','Epic Weapon Focus, Weapon Focus, Weapon Specialization (all in the chosen weapon).','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Add +4 to all damage the character deals using the selected weapon. If the weapon is a ranged weapon, the damage bonus only applies if the target is within 30 feet.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time the character takes the feat, it applies to a different type of weapon.','\n      <div topic=\"Epic Weapon Specialization\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Epic Weapon Specialization [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisites\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Epic Weapon Focus, Weapon Focus, Weapon Specialization (all in the chosen weapon).</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Add +4 to all damage the character deals using the selected weapon. If the weapon is a ranged weapon, the damage bonus only applies if the target is within 30 feet.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time the character takes the feat, it applies to a different type of weapon.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (70,'Epic Will','Epic','No','No',NULL,NULL,'<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character gains a +4 bonus on all Will saving throws.</p><p/>\n</div>\n',NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Epic Will\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Epic Will [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character gains a +4 bonus on all Will saving throws.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (71,'Exceptional Deflection','Epic','No','No',NULL,'Dex 21, Wis 19, Deflect Arrows, Improved Unarmed Strike.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character can deflect any ranged attacks (including spells that require ranged touch attacks) as if they were arrows.</p><p/>\n</div>\n',NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Exceptional Deflection\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Exceptional Deflection [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisites\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Dex 21, Wis 19, Deflect Arrows, Improved Unarmed Strike.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character can deflect any ranged attacks (including spells that require ranged touch attacks) as if they were arrows.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (72,'Extended Life Span','Epic','Yes','Yes',NULL,NULL,'<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Add one-half the maximum result of the character\'s race\'s maximum age modifier to the character\'s normal middle age, old, and venerable age categories. Calculate the character\'s maximum age using the new venerable number. This feat can\'t lower the character\'s current age category.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.','\n      <div topic=\"Extended Life Span\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Extended Life Span [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Add one-half the maximum result of the character\'s race\'s maximum age modifier to the character\'s normal middle age, old, and venerable age categories. Calculate the character\'s maximum age using the new venerable number. This feat can\'t lower the character\'s current age category.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (73,'Familiar Spell','Epic','Yes','No','One arcane spell the character knows of 8th level or lower','Int 25 (if the character\'s spellcasting is controlled by Intelligence) or Cha 25 (if the character\'s spellcasting is controlled by Charisma).','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Choose one arcane spell the character knows of 8th level or lower. The character\'s familiar can now use this spell once per day as a spell-like ability, at a caster level equal to the character\'s caster level. A character cannot bestow a spell to his or her familiar if the spell normally has a material component cost of more than 1 gp or an XP cost.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'A character can gain this feat multiple times. Each time the character takes the feat, he or she can give his or her familiar a different spell-like ability or another daily use of the same spell-like ability.','\n      <div topic=\"Familiar Spell\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Familiar Spell [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisite\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> Int 25 (if the character\'s spellcasting is controlled by Intelligence) or Cha 25 (if the character\'s spellcasting is controlled by Charisma).</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Choose one arcane spell the character knows of 8th level or lower. The character\'s familiar can now use this spell once per day as a spell-like ability, at a caster level equal to the character\'s caster level. A character cannot bestow a spell to his or her familiar if the spell normally has a material component cost of more than 1 gp or an XP cost.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> A character can gain this feat multiple times. Each time the character takes the feat, he or she can give his or her familiar a different spell-like ability or another daily use of the same spell-like ability.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (74,'Fast Healing','Epic','Yes','Yes',NULL,'Con 25.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character gains fast healing 3, or the character\'s existing fast healing increases by 3. This feat does not stack with fast healing granted by magic items or nonpermanent magical effects.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'This feat may be taken multiple times. Its effects stack.','\n      <div topic=\"Fast Healing\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Fast Healing [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisite\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> Con 25.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character gains fast healing 3, or the character\'s existing fast healing increases by 3. This feat does not stack with fast healing granted by magic items or nonpermanent magical effects.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> This feat may be taken multiple times. Its effects stack.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (75,'Fine Wild Shape','Wild, Epic','No','No',NULL,'Ability to wild shape into a Diminutive creature.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character can use his or her <i>wild shape</i> to take the shape of a Fine animal.</p>\n</div>\n','Without this feat, a character cannot wild shape into an animal smaller than Tiny size.',NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Fine Wild Shape\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Fine Wild Shape [Wild] [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisite\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> Ability to <i>wild shape</i> into a Diminutive creatur<i>e</i>. </p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character can use his or her <i>wild shape</i> to take the shape of a Fine animal.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Normal\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Normal:</b> Without this feat, a character cannot <i>wild shape</i> into an animal smaller than Tiny size.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (76,'Forge Epic Ring','Item Creation, Epic','No','No',NULL,'Forge Ring, Knowledge (arcana) 35 ranks, Spellcraft 35 ranks.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character can forge magic rings that exceed the normal limits for such items.</p><p/>\n</div>\n',NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Forge Epic Ring\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Forge Epic Ring [Item Creation] [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisites\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Forge Ring, Knowledge (arcana) 35 ranks, Spellcraft 35 ranks.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character can forge magic rings that exceed the normal limits for such items.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (77,'Gargantuan Wild Shape','Wild, Epic','No','No',NULL,'Ability to wild shape into a Huge animal.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character can use your <i>wild shape</i> to take the shape of a Gargantuan animal.</p>\n</div>\n','Without this feat, a character cannot wild shape into an animal greater than Huge size.',NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Gargantuan Wild Shape\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Gargantuan Wild Shape [Wild] [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisite\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> Ability to <i>wild shape</i> into a Huge animal.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character can use your <i>wild shape</i> to take the shape of a Gargantuan animal.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Normal\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Normal:</b> Without this feat, a character cannot <i>wild shape</i> into an animal greater than Huge size.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (78,'Great Charisma','Epic','Yes','Yes',NULL,NULL,'<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s Charisma increases by 1 point.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.','\n      <div topic=\"Great Charisma\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Great Charisma [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s Charisma increases by 1 point.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (79,'Great Constitution','Epic','Yes','Yes',NULL,NULL,'<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s Constitution increases by 1 point.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.','\n      <div topic=\"Great Constitution\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Great Constitution [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s Constitution increases by 1 point.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (80,'Great Dexterity','Epic','Yes','Yes',NULL,NULL,'<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s Dexterity increases by 1 point.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.','\n      <div topic=\"Great Dexterity\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Great Dexterity [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s Dexterity increases by 1 point.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (81,'Great Intelligence','Epic','Yes','Yes',NULL,NULL,'<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s Intelligence increases by 1 point.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.','\n      <div topic=\"Great Intelligence\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Great Intelligence [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s Intelligence increases by 1 point.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (82,'Great Smiting','Epic','Yes','Yes',NULL,'Cha 25, smite ability (from class feature or domain granted power).','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Whenever the character makes a successful smite attack, add twice the appropriate level to damage (rather than just the character\'s level).</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'A character may select this feat multiple times. Its effects stack. Remember that two doublings equals a tripling, and so forth.','\n      <div topic=\"Great Smiting\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Great Smiting [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisites\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Cha 25, smite ability (from class feature or domain granted power).</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Whenever the character makes a successful smite attack, add twice the appropriate level to damage (rather than just the character\'s level).</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> A character may select this feat multiple times. Its effects stack. Remember that two doublings equals a tripling, and so forth.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (83,'Great Strength','Epic','Yes','Yes',NULL,NULL,'<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s Strength increases by 1 point.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.','\n      <div topic=\"Great Strength\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Great Strength [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s Strength increases by 1 point.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (84,'Great Wisdom','Epic','Yes','Yes',NULL,NULL,'<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s Wisdom increases by 1 point.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.','\n      <div topic=\"Great Wisdom\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Great Wisdom [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s Wisdom increases by 1 point.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (85,'Group Inspiration','Epic','Yes','Yes',NULL,'Perform 30 ranks, bardic music class feature.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The number of allies the character can affect with his or her inspire competence or inspire greatness bardic music ability doubles. When inspiring competence in multiple allies, the character can choose different skills to inspire for different allies.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack. Remember that two doublings equals a tripling, and so forth.','\n      <div topic=\"Group Inspiration\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Group Inspiration [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisite\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> Perform 30 ranks, bardic music class feature.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The number of allies the character can affect with his or her inspire competence or inspire greatness bardic music ability doubles. When inspiring competence in multiple allies, the character can choose different skills to inspire for different allies.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> A character can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects stack. Remember that two doublings equals a tripling, and so forth.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (86,'Hindering Song','Epic','No','No',NULL,'Deafening Song, Perform 27 ranks, bardic music class feature.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character can use song or poetics to hinder enemy spellcasters within a 30-foot spread from the character. To successfully cast a spell within this area, a spellcaster must make a Concentration check as if he or she were casting defensively, and all such checks have a penalty equal to half the character\'s level. The character can choose to exclude any characters from this effect. The character may sing, play, or recite a hindering song while taking other mundane actions, but not magical ones (see the bard\'s inspire courage ability for more details). The character may keep up the hindering song for a maximum of 10 rounds. Using the hindering song counts as one of the character\'s uses of song or poetics for the day.</p><p/>\n</div>\n',NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Hindering Song\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Hindering Song [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisite\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> Deafening Song, Perform 27 ranks, bardic music class feature.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character can use song or poetics to hinder enemy spellcasters within a 30-foot spread from the character. To successfully cast a spell within this area, a spellcaster must make a Concentration check as if he or she were casting defensively, and all such checks have a penalty equal to half the character\'s level. The character can choose to exclude any characters from this effect. The character may sing, play, or recite a hindering song while taking other mundane actions, but not magical ones (see the bard\'s inspire courage ability for more details). The character may keep up the hindering song for a maximum of 10 rounds. Using the hindering song counts as one of the character\'s uses of song or poetics for the day.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (87,'Holy Strike','Epic','No','No',NULL,'Smite evil class feature, any good alignment.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Any weapon the character wields is treated as a holy weapon (is good-aligned and deals an extra 2d6 points of damage against creatures of evil alignment). If the weapon already has an alignment, this feat has no effect on the weapon.</p><p/>\n</div>\n',NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Holy Strike\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Holy Strike [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisites\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Smite evil class feature, any good alignment.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Any weapon the character wields is treated as a holy weapon (is good-aligned and deals an extra 2d6 points of damage against creatures of evil alignment). If the weapon already has an alignment, this feat has no effect on the weapon.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (88,'Ignore Material Components','Epic','No','No',NULL,'Eschew Materials, Spellcraft 25 ranks, ability to cast 9th-level arcane or divine spells.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character may cast spells without any material components. This feat does not affect the need for a focus or divine focus.</p><p/>\n</div>\n',NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Ignore Material Components\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Ignore Material Components [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisites\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Eschew Materials, Spellcraft 25 ranks, ability to cast 9th-level arcane or divine spells.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character may cast spells without any material components. This feat does not affect the need for a focus or divine focus.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (89,'Improved Alignment-Based Casting','Epic','Yes','No','An alignment-based domain (Chaos, Evil, Good, or Law) to which the character has access','Access to domain of Chaos, Evil, Good, or Law, alignment must match domain chosen, ability to cast 9th-level divine spells.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Select an alignment-based domain (Chaos, Evil, Good, or Law) to which the character has access. The character casts spells with that alignment descriptor at +3 caster level.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'This benefit overrides (does not stack with) the granted powers of the Chaos, Evil, Good, and Law domains. A character may select this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time a character takes the feat, it applies to a different alignment-based domain to which the character has access.','\n      <div topic=\"Improved Alignment-Based Casting\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Improved Alignment-Based Casting [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisites\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Access to domain of Chaos, Evil, Good, or Law, alignment must match domain chosen, ability to cast 9th-level divine spells.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Select an alignment-based domain (Chaos, Evil, Good, or Law) to which the character has access. The character casts spells with that alignment descriptor at +3 caster level.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> This benefit overrides (does not stack with) the granted powers of the Chaos, Evil, Good, and Law domains. A character may select this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time a character takes the feat, it applies to a different alignment-based domain to which the character has access.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (90,'Improved Arrow of Death','Epic','Yes','Yes',NULL,'Dex 19, Wis 19, Point Blank Shot, Precise Shot, arrow of death class feature.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Add +2 to the DC of the character\'s arrows of death. This feat may be taken multiple times. Its effects stack.</p><p/>\n</div>\n',NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Improved Arrow of Death\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Improved Arrow of Death [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisites\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Dex 19, Wis 19, Point Blank Shot, Precise Shot, arrow of death class feature.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Add +2 to the DC of the character\'s arrows of death. This feat may be taken multiple times. Its effects stack.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (91,'Improved Aura of Courage','Epic','No','No',NULL,'Cha 25, aura of courage class ability.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s aura of courage grants a +8 morale bonus on saving throws against fear effects.</p><p/>\n</div>\n',NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Improved Aura of Courage\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Improved Aura of Courage [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisite\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> Cha 25, aura of courage class ability.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s aura of courage grants a +8 morale bonus on saving throws against fear effects.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (92,'Improved Aura of Despair','Epic','No','No',NULL,'Cha 25, aura of despair class ability.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s aura of despair causes a -4 morale penalty on all saving throws.</p><p/>\n</div>\n',NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Improved Aura of Despair\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Improved Aura of Despair [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisite\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> Cha 25, aura of despair class ability.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s aura of despair causes a -4 morale penalty on all saving throws.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (93,'Improved Combat Casting','Epic','No','No',NULL,'Combat Casting, Concentration 25 ranks.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character doesn\'t incur attacks of opportunity for casting spells when threatened.</p><p/>\n</div>\n',NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Improved Combat Casting\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Improved Combat Casting [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisites\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Combat Casting, Concentration 25 ranks.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character doesn\'t incur attacks of opportunity for casting spells when threatened.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (94,'Improved Combat Reflexes','Epic','No','No',NULL,'Dex 21, Combat Reflexes.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> There is no limit to the number of attacks of opportunity the character can make in one round. (the character still can\'t make more than one attack of opportunity for a given oppertunity.)</p><p/>\n</div>\n',NULL,NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Improved Combat Reflexes\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Improved Combat Reflexes [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisites\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Dex 21, Combat Reflexes.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> There is no limit to the number of attacks of opportunity the character can make in one round. (the character still can\'t make more than one attack of opportunity for a given oppertunity.)</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (95,'Improved Darkvision','Epic','Yes','Yes',NULL,'Darkvision.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The range of the character\'s darkvision doubles. This feat does not stack with darkvision granted by magic items or nonpermanent magical effects.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'This feat may be taken multiple times. Its effects stack. Remember that two doublings equals a tripling, and so on.','\n      <div topic=\"Improved Darkvision\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Improved Darkvision [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisite\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> Darkvision.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The range of the character\'s darkvision doubles. This feat does not stack with darkvision granted by magic items or nonpermanent magical effects.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> This feat may be taken multiple times. Its effects stack. Remember that two doublings equals a tripling, and so on.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (96,'Improved Death Attack','Epic','Yes','Yes',NULL,'Death attack class feature, sneak attack +5d6.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Add +2 to the DC of the character\'s death attack.</p>\n</div>\n',NULL,'This feat may be taken multiple times. Its effects stack.','\n      <div topic=\"Improved Death Attack\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Improved Death Attack [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisites\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Death attack class feature, sneak attack +5d6.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> Add +2 to the DC of the character\'s death attack.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Special\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Special:</b> This feat may be taken multiple times. Its effects stack.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
INSERT INTO feat VALUES (97,'Improved Elemental Wild Shape','Wild, Epic','No','No',NULL,'Wis 25, ability to wild shape into an elemental.','<div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s ability to <i>wild shape</i> into an elemental is expanded to include all elemental creatures (not just air, earth, fire, and water elementals) of any size that the character can take when using <i>wild shape</i> to become an animal. The character gains all extraordinary and supernatural abilities of the elemental whose form he or she takes.</p>\n</div>\n','Without this feat, a character may only wild shape into a Small, Medium-size, or Large air, earth, fire, or water elemental.',NULL,'\n      <div topic=\"Improved Elemental Wild Shape\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Improved Elemental Wild Shape [Wild] [Epic]</h3></p><div topic=\"Prerequisites\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Wis 25, ability to <i>wild shape</i> into an elemental.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Benefit\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Benefit:</b> The character\'s ability to <i>wild shape</i> into an elemental is expanded to include all elemental creatures (not just air, earth, fire, and water elementals) of any size that the character can take when using <i>wild shape</i> to become an animal. The character gains all extraordinary and supernatural abilities of the elemental whose form he or she takes.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Normal\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Normal:</b> Without this feat, a character may only <i>wild shape</i> into a Small, Medium-size, or Large air, earth, fire, or water elemental.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicFeats');
